# Bambda domain exclusion list
# Copy to ~/.api-sentinel/bambda-domains.txt and customize
# Format: comma-separated, wildcards allowed (*.)
#
# Example:
# *.internal.company.com,analytics.example.com,telemetry.example.com
#
# Common browser/CDN noise is built-in as default when this file is absent.

detectportal.firefox.com,getpocket.cdn.mozilla.net,safebrowsing.googleapis.com,www.google-analytics.com,hm.baidu.com
